      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُطَّلَاتٌ</span></b>  (pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُطَّلٌ</span>, TA) <i>False,</i> or <i>vain, things;</i>
or <i>unprofitable sayings.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, K.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ بِالبُطَّلَاتِ</span> <i>He uttered false,</i> or <i>vain,
things;</i> &amp;c. (El-Moheet, TA.)

